WEBVTT

00:04.421 --> 00:06.923
[intriguing music playing]

00:08.008 --> 00:10.051
- [metal clattering]
- [tapping]

00:11.553 --> 00:12.929
[dramatic music playing]

00:13.013 --> 00:14.305
MOSH PIT

00:16.391 --> 00:19.227
What? What are these guys doing here?

00:21.271 --> 00:22.814
[gasps] Huh?

00:22.897 --> 00:23.773
En?

00:24.649 --> 00:27.318
- [all gasping, murmuring]
- There's no way. You're still alive?

00:27.402 --> 00:30.905
You pieces of shit,
don't play dumb with us!

00:30.989 --> 00:34.826
We know you're the ones who killed En.
You've got his head somewhere, don't you!?

00:34.909 --> 00:38.329
En is still dead. This is just a doll.

00:38.413 --> 00:41.583
A tool that's leading us
to the location of his body.

00:44.294 --> 00:45.253
[gasps]

00:45.795 --> 00:49.591
I see! So the head is in this room.

00:49.674 --> 00:52.886
I wonder if we'll find
the Cross-Eyes' boss inside with it?

00:52.969 --> 00:53.970
[fearful whimpering]

00:54.054 --> 00:58.516
Well, anyway,
as a cleaner of the En Family,

00:58.600 --> 01:00.852
it will be my pleasure

01:01.978 --> 01:03.646
to kill you all!

01:03.730 --> 01:04.647
- [screaming]
- [grunts]

01:06.733 --> 01:07.650
Doku--

01:07.734 --> 01:09.903
- [muffled groan]
- [Noi grunting, yell]

01:09.986 --> 01:11.029
[muffled gasping]

01:11.112 --> 01:12.697
[Noi laughing]

01:12.781 --> 01:13.656
[pained grunt]

01:13.740 --> 01:16.451
[coughing, spluttering]

01:16.534 --> 01:17.452
Ton!

01:17.535 --> 01:19.162
She never learns.

01:19.245 --> 01:22.957
I told Noi a thousand times
she has to be careful of their attacks.

01:23.041 --> 01:24.459
- [growling]
- He's using Magic!

01:24.542 --> 01:25.960
Not if I can seal it off!

01:26.044 --> 01:27.128
[Shin grunts]

01:28.296 --> 01:32.300
Turns out dodging is a lot easier
if I know where you're aiming.

01:32.383 --> 01:33.301
[gasps]

01:33.384 --> 01:34.803
[gasping weakly]

01:34.886 --> 01:36.304
[pained grunting]

01:36.387 --> 01:37.430
[grunts angrily]

01:37.514 --> 01:38.723
[yells ferociously]

01:41.559 --> 01:44.479
- [Natsuki yelps]
- Hurry, get in there and hide!

01:44.562 --> 01:46.356
- [Saji] Hey, Ton!
- One more time!

01:46.439 --> 01:47.482
[Shin] Idiots.

01:50.068 --> 01:51.861
[suspenseful music building]

01:54.697 --> 01:56.116
[Ushishimada] Ton! Saji!

01:56.199 --> 01:57.992
[squeaking]

01:58.952 --> 02:00.286
[Ushishimada growling]

02:01.329 --> 02:02.914
- [Noi grunts]
- [pained grunt, struggling]

02:02.997 --> 02:04.624
You already healed? You demon!

02:04.707 --> 02:05.834
[Natsuki] Ushishimada!

02:05.917 --> 02:09.212
[Ushishimada] Natsuki, go on ahead.
[struggling] Get the boss-

02:09.295 --> 02:10.755
[strangled gagging]

02:10.839 --> 02:12.257
Hurry...

02:14.384 --> 02:15.510
[Natsuki] All right.

02:16.094 --> 02:19.931
[Shin] Noi, I'll leave the rest to you.
I'll go after the doll.

02:20.014 --> 02:21.266
[Noi] Roger that!

02:21.349 --> 02:23.434
[Shin] Put the dismembered ones in a bag.

02:23.518 --> 02:24.644
- [elevator dings]
- [Shin] Huh?

02:30.733 --> 02:31.901
Hm?

02:33.486 --> 02:35.738
[labored breathing]

02:37.490 --> 02:39.284
There's no one here.

02:40.702 --> 02:41.911
Did he leave?

02:41.995 --> 02:43.413
[uneasy music playing]

02:46.666 --> 02:48.376
Oh, En...

02:52.964 --> 02:55.466
[gasps] What's this?

02:55.967 --> 02:57.510
There's a hole in his head.

02:57.594 --> 02:59.262
[gasps, grunts]

02:59.345 --> 03:01.014
[dramatic music playing]

03:03.224 --> 03:04.434
[Shin grunts]

03:04.934 --> 03:06.227
[both grunting]

03:07.312 --> 03:08.730
[blowing slowly]

03:09.397 --> 03:10.398
[pained groaning]

03:10.481 --> 03:11.900
[Shin struggling]

03:15.862 --> 03:17.113
[metal shattering]

03:17.197 --> 03:18.323
[Dokuga grunts]

03:21.492 --> 03:23.703
[grunting]

03:24.370 --> 03:25.538
[Shin yells painfully]

03:26.623 --> 03:27.624
[Dokuga gasps]

03:27.707 --> 03:29.042
[gasps]

03:29.125 --> 03:30.418
[labored breathing]

03:31.336 --> 03:32.253
[groans softly]

03:33.046 --> 03:34.047
[Shin chuckling]

03:35.632 --> 03:38.676
Well now, aren't you a hard worker?

03:38.760 --> 03:41.012
[Dokuga yells angrily, grunts]

03:44.182 --> 03:45.016
[Shin grunts]

03:46.351 --> 03:48.937
Oh, come on, don't stop now!

03:50.855 --> 03:51.856
[Shin grunts loudly]

03:52.649 --> 03:54.859
[grunts, labored breathing]

03:58.112 --> 03:59.864
Your attacks are slowing down.

04:02.367 --> 04:04.661
So why don't we finish this?

04:04.744 --> 04:06.120
[ragged breathing]

04:06.204 --> 04:07.163
[Tetsujo] Dokuga!

04:07.247 --> 04:08.331
Use this!

04:09.999 --> 04:11.084
- Huh?
- [gasps]

04:11.876 --> 04:13.795
[screaming ferociously]

04:13.878 --> 04:15.546
[Shin] I said let's finish this.

04:20.093 --> 04:21.261
[Dokuga, weakly] Boss...

04:24.597 --> 04:26.724
These guys never know when to give up.

04:26.808 --> 04:28.768
Dokuga!

04:30.311 --> 04:31.271
[Natsuki] Huh?

04:33.398 --> 04:35.650
Oh no. I hope they're okay.

04:36.150 --> 04:38.236
I need to find the boss as soon as I can!

04:38.319 --> 04:39.821
[tense music playing]

04:45.827 --> 04:47.287
[footsteps echoing]

04:49.539 --> 04:51.874
Is... is that... the boss?

04:56.045 --> 04:57.755
Huh? En?!

04:58.423 --> 04:59.841
[pained groaning]

04:59.924 --> 05:01.843
Hey! Knock it off!

05:04.137 --> 05:05.013
[doll body thuds]

05:05.096 --> 05:06.597
[whispy sizzling]

05:08.516 --> 05:11.019
[gasps] So much blood! What should I do?

05:11.102 --> 05:12.395
Huh?

05:12.478 --> 05:14.314
It almost looks as though

05:14.814 --> 05:16.649
this guy did surgery on himself!

05:17.608 --> 05:19.152
[hesitating] What should I do?

05:19.235 --> 05:21.112
Because at this rate...

05:21.988 --> 05:23.239
[chittering]

05:23.906 --> 05:25.575
[Kasukabe] Haru, are you certain

05:25.658 --> 05:28.119
you can figure out
where Shin and the others are?

05:28.202 --> 05:29.537
[demonic voice] Yeah, easy-peasy.

05:29.620 --> 05:33.833
In fact, it's boring.
I couldn't care less about this.

05:34.375 --> 05:35.626
Here we are.

05:36.127 --> 05:39.589
[Kasukabe] So the leader of the Cross-Eyes
is just inside...

05:39.672 --> 05:41.049
Ai, is it you?

05:41.132 --> 05:43.051
HEALING A+

05:43.718 --> 05:45.178
[Natsuki whimpering]

05:48.306 --> 05:50.016
The crosses in his eyes...

05:50.516 --> 05:52.685
They're not tattoos like ours are.

05:52.769 --> 05:54.771
They're like birthmarks.

05:55.271 --> 05:57.482
[squelching]

05:58.274 --> 05:59.442
[gasps fearfully]

06:02.028 --> 06:03.363
Uh, hello!

06:03.863 --> 06:05.698
Hi there, my name is Natsuki.

06:06.324 --> 06:07.825
It's nice to finally meet...

06:07.909 --> 06:09.285
[fearful wail]

06:10.578 --> 06:12.705
[gruff voice] My name is...

06:12.789 --> 06:14.791
[Natsuki whimpering]

06:17.210 --> 06:18.044
...Kai.

06:19.128 --> 06:19.962
[Noi grunts]

06:20.046 --> 06:23.091
- Hey, Noi, are you done over there?
- [Noi sighs]

06:23.591 --> 06:25.093
Yeah, I'm all done!

06:25.176 --> 06:29.097
This one wasn't dismembered,
so I just put him directly in a bag.

06:29.180 --> 06:30.932
[Shin] Mm, I guess that's fine.

06:31.015 --> 06:34.227
[Noi] Shin... [chuckles]
...we're really not gonna kill these guys?

06:34.310 --> 06:36.229
[Shin] We can kill them anytime.

06:36.312 --> 06:39.649
But there are many things
I want to ask them first

06:40.316 --> 06:41.859
By the way, where's the doll?

06:42.944 --> 06:43.861
[Noi gasps]

06:43.945 --> 06:46.864
This is... like six years ago.

06:47.657 --> 06:49.617
This feeling, it's like...

06:50.952 --> 06:52.078
it's like the Hole's...

06:53.246 --> 06:54.080
Huh? What?!

06:54.163 --> 06:56.082
Is this smoke? [grunts]

06:57.667 --> 06:58.835
[Shin gasping]

06:58.918 --> 07:00.586
It's impossible!

07:01.337 --> 07:03.214
[Noi] This is En's...

07:03.798 --> 07:04.715
[wheezy gasping]

07:04.799 --> 07:06.551
[Noi and Shin gasping weakly]

07:06.634 --> 07:08.219
[daunting music playing]

07:12.098 --> 07:13.224
[mirthful growling]

07:13.307 --> 07:15.726
[gasping weakly] You... But you're...

07:16.602 --> 07:17.728
No way...

07:18.813 --> 07:20.064
It can't be.

07:20.565 --> 07:22.191
[gasping]

07:22.275 --> 07:23.985
[monstrous breathing]

07:25.570 --> 07:27.488
[muffled screaming]

07:29.574 --> 07:31.993
- [monstrous breathing]
- [Noi's muffled screams continue]

07:32.076 --> 07:33.202
[Kai gasps]

07:34.328 --> 07:35.288
[confused gasping]

07:35.872 --> 07:37.790
[Curse] I found you.

07:41.210 --> 07:42.253
[elevator dings]

07:45.089 --> 07:48.009
[Kasukabe] Wow, this place is a mess.

07:48.092 --> 07:49.510
- [Haru] Ah!
- [Kasukabe yelps]

07:49.594 --> 07:51.012
What is it, Haru?

07:51.095 --> 07:54.849
[Haru] I just had a great idea for a song.
Wanna hear it?

07:54.932 --> 07:56.017
[Kasukabe] Right now?

07:56.809 --> 08:01.397
[Curse] You took my life away,
now I will take everything from you.

08:01.981 --> 08:04.984
And this time, nothing will stop me.

08:06.110 --> 08:07.904
- [demonic singing in distance]
- [Curse screams]

08:07.987 --> 08:11.032
BLOOD DRIPPING ON THE WALL SO DIRTY

08:11.115 --> 08:13.659
I THIS RUN-DOWN BUILDING
WHAT BUSINESS DO YOU HAVE?

08:13.743 --> 08:17.163
[Kasukabe] You know, next time,
you can just read me the lyrics!

08:17.246 --> 08:18.789
[Risu gasping]

08:18.873 --> 08:19.916
A devil's song!

08:19.999 --> 08:21.375
[screaming]

08:26.672 --> 08:27.590
[Haru] Huh?

08:28.257 --> 08:30.760
What's wrong, Hayes? Did you fall asleep?

08:31.260 --> 08:32.845
[Jonson] Shocking...

08:33.471 --> 08:35.139
[Haru] Let's go home, then.

08:36.933 --> 08:39.185
- [uneasy music playing]
- [pained grunting]

08:39.268 --> 08:40.436
[gasps]

08:43.439 --> 08:44.524
[gasps]

08:44.607 --> 08:45.525
[Dokuga] Huh?

08:45.608 --> 08:47.109
[dramatic music playing]

08:48.736 --> 08:50.363
[Dokuga] B... Boss?

08:50.446 --> 08:51.906
[all gasping]

08:53.950 --> 08:55.326
[Dokuga] Take this...

09:06.629 --> 09:08.089
One month later,

09:08.965 --> 09:11.384
the En Family was destroyed.

09:12.468 --> 09:14.303
[frantic electronic music playing]

09:26.857 --> 09:28.359
[lyrics in Japanese]

10:39.722 --> 10:41.015
THE BEGINNING

10:41.098 --> 10:41.974
[music fades]

10:42.058 --> 10:44.477
CROSS-EYES IN THE NEWS

10:44.560 --> 10:45.519
SHOCK OF EN FAMILY FALL

10:45.603 --> 10:46.479
[Tanba] Fukuyama!

10:46.562 --> 10:49.231
[Fukuyama] "One month after En's murder,

10:49.315 --> 10:52.860
the Cross-Eyes have occupied
his enormous mansion."

10:52.943 --> 10:55.988
"And the En family
have since rapidly declined

10:56.072 --> 10:58.282
after losing their powerful boss."

10:58.366 --> 11:01.077
"Members of the household,
including the servants,

11:01.160 --> 11:02.620
have fled for their lives."

11:02.703 --> 11:05.623
- [grunts] Go back to work, you idiot!
- [pained gasp]

11:06.207 --> 11:09.168
But, boss,
aren't you just a little bit curious?

11:09.251 --> 11:13.255
I mean, it really wasn't that long ago
that we were selling pie at that place.

11:13.339 --> 11:16.050
That only makes it more upsetting!

11:16.133 --> 11:19.428
Right when our wagon business
was going so well...

11:19.512 --> 11:21.597
Speaking of the Cross-Eyes,

11:22.098 --> 11:24.016
I wonder what ever happened to Caiman.

11:24.100 --> 11:24.934
[groans]

11:25.643 --> 11:29.105
Well, knowing him,
he's probably alive somewhere.

11:31.065 --> 11:32.775
[intriguing music playing]

11:43.703 --> 11:45.955
- [Natsuki] Oh, Dokuga, hi!
- Hmm?

11:46.038 --> 11:48.541
What are you doing
tucked away in that corner?

11:49.625 --> 11:52.586
I brought all the stuff
the boss asked me to bring to him,

11:53.087 --> 11:54.547
but he won't let me in.

11:55.047 --> 11:57.508
Huh? The boss is in this room?!

11:57.591 --> 11:58.426
[Dokuga] Yeah.

11:58.509 --> 12:02.304
We're not supposed to disturb the boss
when he's doing something alone.

12:04.598 --> 12:06.142
What's all this, Natsuki?

12:06.642 --> 12:07.893
[Natsuki] Take a look!

12:07.977 --> 12:11.105
Saji asked me to gather up
all the valuables in the mansion.

12:11.188 --> 12:13.357
But there's still a lot left.

12:13.441 --> 12:15.860
- There's that many?
- You know what this means?

12:15.943 --> 12:19.113
The Cross-Eyes are super rich now.
We're rich!

12:20.406 --> 12:21.240
We're rich?

12:21.323 --> 12:22.992
- [Ushishimada] Hey, Dokuga!
- Hmm?

12:23.075 --> 12:25.077
I got a special delivery!

12:25.161 --> 12:29.498
Seriously, this mansion is way too big.
We're gonna need a map.

12:29.582 --> 12:33.669
Ushishimada, Saji,
are you done cleaning yet?

12:33.753 --> 12:34.754
[Ushishimada] Not at all.

12:35.421 --> 12:37.298
[Saji] There are still bodies
of En's underlings

12:37.381 --> 12:39.300
lying around all over the place.

12:39.383 --> 12:42.011
When we took over,
a bunch of them tried to resist.

12:42.094 --> 12:44.346
Ooh, what's inside this box?

12:44.430 --> 12:47.349
- Nothing much. Come see for yourself.
- [Natsuki] Ooh!

12:48.559 --> 12:51.979
I've been double-checking each
of the bodies we've been picking up,

12:52.062 --> 12:54.982
but I didn't see
any of the so-called officers.

12:55.065 --> 12:57.568
Also the two Cleaners are missing as well.

12:58.068 --> 12:59.570
Our boss is invincible.

13:00.070 --> 13:01.322
It's not a big deal.

13:01.405 --> 13:04.950
[Natsuki] Oh, yeah!
I found something amazing, you guys!

13:05.034 --> 13:06.076
It's in that room.

13:06.160 --> 13:07.995
[exciting music playing]

13:08.078 --> 13:09.705
Gold ingots!

13:10.623 --> 13:13.626
Huh? What gives?
You don't seem to care that much.

13:13.709 --> 13:16.879
Hey, hey, I found something amazing!

13:17.630 --> 13:18.631
[door opening]

13:18.714 --> 13:21.383
A huge stockpile of daily necessities!

13:21.467 --> 13:23.010
- [gasps]
- No way!

13:24.595 --> 13:26.680
Oh wow. We're so rich.

13:26.764 --> 13:29.183
Come on!
This is what you're excited about?

13:30.142 --> 13:32.812
Huh? The hell is that?

13:32.895 --> 13:35.272
That's the door. It leads to the Hole.

13:36.190 --> 13:39.193
It's for anyone
who can't create a door with Magic.

13:39.276 --> 13:41.028
[Ushishimada] So this is it...

13:41.111 --> 13:42.029
[music fades]

13:42.613 --> 13:44.532
MUSHROOM

13:45.115 --> 13:46.033
Mushrooms!

13:46.116 --> 13:47.743
- [gasps]
- [clock En] Mushrooms!

13:47.827 --> 13:49.286
[Dokuga] Oh, It's morning.

13:49.370 --> 13:51.539
- Mushrooms! Mushrooms!
- [Dokuga] That damn clock.

13:51.622 --> 13:53.749
- Mushrooms! Mushrooms!
- It's so annoying.

13:53.833 --> 13:57.127
Although, I just can't throw away
something that still works.

13:57.211 --> 13:59.547
[Tetsujo] Dokuga! We have an emergency!

13:59.630 --> 14:02.174
- Come to the mansion gate right now!
- [clamoring]

14:03.133 --> 14:04.677
Let me in!

14:04.760 --> 14:06.220
Let me see the boss!

14:06.303 --> 14:08.848
[Saji] You've gotta be kidding?
Now they come?

14:08.931 --> 14:11.183
[Ushishimada] What a bunch
of opportunists.

14:11.267 --> 14:13.602
Anyway, we have to consult the boss.

14:14.103 --> 14:15.229
That's what I thought.

14:15.312 --> 14:16.897
Only when I went to tell him,

14:17.439 --> 14:18.440
he was gone.

14:18.524 --> 14:20.150
Huh? Not again?!

14:20.234 --> 14:21.485
You're kidding me!

14:22.695 --> 14:23.696
Boss...

14:24.321 --> 14:27.283
[reporter] A crowd of people
with little or no Magic ability

14:27.366 --> 14:29.952
have started to form outside En's mansion,

14:30.035 --> 14:31.245
What is the Cross-Eyes' goal?

14:31.328 --> 14:34.999
And what is the identity
of the Cross-Eyes' boss?

14:35.082 --> 14:36.208
[slurping]

14:36.292 --> 14:37.793
[satisfied sigh]

14:37.877 --> 14:40.296
Oh! This is ridiculous.

14:40.379 --> 14:42.756
Bye, ma'am, I'll leave the money here.

14:42.840 --> 14:44.216
[woman] Thank you!

14:45.885 --> 14:47.177
[groans contentedly]

14:47.261 --> 14:49.430
I've got nothing but free time.

14:49.513 --> 14:53.726
I wonder if there's anything fun
to do around here. Something like...

14:53.809 --> 14:54.935
Huh?

14:55.019 --> 14:57.521
[bully 1] Come on, show us some Magic.

14:57.605 --> 14:59.440
[boy] I, I can't. I can't use it.

14:59.523 --> 15:03.319
Why not, huh?
You're a student there, aren't you?

15:03.402 --> 15:05.195
Come on, use some Magic.

15:05.279 --> 15:06.739
[boy] Please stop it.

15:06.822 --> 15:09.116
Don't talk back, you piece of trash.

15:09.199 --> 15:12.494
Guys like you are no better
than the people from the Hole.

15:12.578 --> 15:13.704
Fine, then.

15:13.787 --> 15:16.290
I'll use you to practice my-- [groaning]

15:16.373 --> 15:18.542
- Huh? What the... Hey!
- [Aikawa] Hi-yah!

15:18.626 --> 15:21.629
- [Aikawa yelling playfully]
- [screaming]

15:21.712 --> 15:24.298
- [jaunty music playing]
- [Aikawa chuckling]

15:24.381 --> 15:27.301
That was some good exercise
to help my digestion.

15:27.384 --> 15:29.887
- Excuse me, you're Aikawa, right?
- Huh?

15:29.970 --> 15:33.265
It's me! We were in the same class
at school in Zagan.

15:33.349 --> 15:34.475
[Aikawa] Oh!

15:35.643 --> 15:39.104
[boy] En shut that school down
a few years ago.

15:39.772 --> 15:43.275
It was a hotbed for the black powder
the Cross-Eyes were selling.

15:43.359 --> 15:44.485
[Aikawa] Hmm...

15:44.568 --> 15:47.404
[boy] But a new school
was built recently.

15:47.488 --> 15:49.323
It's really close by.

15:49.406 --> 15:52.159
ACCEPTING APPLICATIONS
FOR TRIAL ENROLMENT

15:52.868 --> 15:55.287
- Did you submit your application?
- [Aikawa] Yeah.

15:56.163 --> 15:59.083
Wow, this place is great! I love it.

15:59.166 --> 16:00.918
[boy] I am worried though.

16:01.001 --> 16:04.338
The Cross-Eyes will definitely
start selling black powder.

16:04.421 --> 16:07.049
Just when people had finally
started practicing again

16:07.132 --> 16:08.801
after it stopped circulating.

16:10.177 --> 16:13.597
Even at school,
the Cross-Eyes are all anyone talks about.

16:14.223 --> 16:17.601
Everyone seems pretty happy
that the En family was destroyed.

16:17.685 --> 16:20.354
Oh, by the way, how's Risu doing?

16:20.437 --> 16:21.397
[Aikawa] Hmm?

16:21.480 --> 16:24.108
Hmm... I don't know.

16:24.191 --> 16:27.611
Hey, Aikawa, I'll treat you
to something in the cafeteria.

16:27.695 --> 16:29.196
Yippee!

16:29.738 --> 16:32.116
[Aikawa humming happily]

16:32.199 --> 16:33.826
- [gasps]
- [gasps]

16:33.909 --> 16:35.577
[cook] Aikawa, you bastard!

16:35.661 --> 16:38.163
[Aikawa] They rehired
an old geezer like you?

16:38.247 --> 16:40.833
Keep running! Stay away from this school!

16:40.916 --> 16:43.085
Bye-bye! See you tomorrow!

16:43.168 --> 16:44.420
[boy] See you tomorrow!

16:44.503 --> 16:48.590
Do I have to keep this guy from eating all
the school's food for my entire career?

16:49.758 --> 16:52.720
[Aikawa] All right, let's see.
What else should I do today?

16:59.601 --> 17:02.187
It's been a while since I came here.

17:03.689 --> 17:06.358
Risu. Hey, are you there?

17:07.609 --> 17:09.403
- Huh?
- [door creaking]

17:09.486 --> 17:11.030
[uneasy music playing]

17:12.197 --> 17:13.866
[man] You better let us in!

17:13.949 --> 17:17.953
[Natsuki] Ton, are we really going to let
those people join the Cross-Eyes?

17:18.037 --> 17:19.038
Guess so.

17:19.121 --> 17:23.125
[Natsuki] But aren't they just
after our money and stuff like that?

17:23.667 --> 17:24.626
Probably.

17:25.169 --> 17:27.921
But we can find a good use
for people like them.

17:28.505 --> 17:30.174
We can pay them to work,

17:30.257 --> 17:32.926
and control them
by making them fear the boss.

17:33.010 --> 17:36.513
Still, if we let them into the mansion,

17:36.597 --> 17:40.309
what's to stop a couple of them
from trying to assassinate the boss?

17:40.392 --> 17:43.187
Don't worry, I have an idea for that.

17:43.270 --> 17:44.146
[chuckles]

17:45.105 --> 17:48.067
- I found this lying around the other day.
- [device whirring]

17:48.150 --> 17:52.279
It was En's invention.
It's a portable Magic inspection device.

17:53.280 --> 17:56.200
This thing can quantify
the level of Sorcerers.

17:56.742 --> 17:58.786
We can check people
before they enter the mansion.

17:58.869 --> 18:01.163
- To see whether they're assassins.
- Wow!

18:01.246 --> 18:02.247
[giggling]

18:02.331 --> 18:04.917
Come on Ton, check me, check me!

18:05.000 --> 18:06.293
Why not?

18:06.376 --> 18:08.629
But you might be disappointed.

18:08.712 --> 18:11.131
[sloshing]

18:12.091 --> 18:15.052
What is this black liquid?
No one's ever told me.

18:15.803 --> 18:19.389
Back in the day, we'd always find
this stuff in the boss's room.

18:19.473 --> 18:22.559
Speaking of,
where the hell has he gone to now?

18:23.102 --> 18:24.812
Will he be away for a long time again?

18:24.895 --> 18:27.940
He won't. It's different this time.

18:28.524 --> 18:31.944
Hey, Dokuga.
Could you just tell me already?

18:32.027 --> 18:34.655
What really happened
to the boss back then?

18:37.074 --> 18:39.701
You have to promise not to tell them.

18:39.785 --> 18:41.203
Uh, sure.

18:41.829 --> 18:42.788
But why not?

18:43.580 --> 18:46.583
[Dokuga] The boss found someone
with a special kind of Magic,

18:47.084 --> 18:48.961
a Magic that he wanted.

18:49.461 --> 18:50.420
Risu.

18:50.504 --> 18:52.631
[Tetsujo] You mean, the Curse is... [gasps]

18:52.714 --> 18:53.549
[Dokuga] Right.

18:53.632 --> 18:55.884
Risu's magic is Curse-type,

18:56.552 --> 18:59.304
And his Curse befalls
anyone who kills him.

18:59.388 --> 19:01.849
- [tense music playing]
- The transaction's at four.

19:01.932 --> 19:04.351
It'll be at the ruins
in the Salmanazar Plateau.

19:04.434 --> 19:07.938
Is it all right
if I bring my partner along again?

19:08.021 --> 19:11.066
He's not a member of the team,
but he's someone I trust.

19:11.150 --> 19:14.820
[Tanabe] No, don't bring anyone.
You have to go alone this time.

19:14.903 --> 19:16.280
[intriguing music playing]

19:18.532 --> 19:21.577
Are you sure about this one?
'Cause I don't know.

19:21.660 --> 19:24.705
[Tetsujo] That's Risu?
I've never seen him before.

19:24.788 --> 19:27.791
You sure you can trust him?
It's an important deal, right?

19:27.875 --> 19:28.709
It's fine.

19:30.377 --> 19:31.962
Who's that guy with him?

19:32.045 --> 19:35.090
He's Risu's partner. His name is Aikawa.

19:35.174 --> 19:36.967
They always hang out together.

19:38.802 --> 19:40.095
Aikawa...

19:41.388 --> 19:45.642
After that, I think The Boss killed Risu
at the Salmanazar Plateau.

19:45.726 --> 19:49.062
So the Boss killed Risu
and brought the curse on himself?

19:49.980 --> 19:53.525
This is important!
How could you keep this from us?

19:55.152 --> 19:57.821
I thought it was better
if everyone didn't know.

19:58.322 --> 19:59.489
Otherwise,

20:00.115 --> 20:02.993
we'd all know that the boss is willing
to kill his own people.

20:03.076 --> 20:03.911
[Tetsujo gasps]

20:03.994 --> 20:08.624
Hey, we still need the boss to survive,
though, don't you think?

20:08.707 --> 20:09.541
Tetsujo.

20:09.625 --> 20:10.626
[gasps]

20:11.835 --> 20:13.128
Think about it.

20:13.921 --> 20:16.882
In a way, now it's us who are using him.

20:17.883 --> 20:19.426
[ominous music playing]

20:19.509 --> 20:21.803
[Risu] Who killed me? Who?!

20:22.888 --> 20:25.265
Why did you kill me?

20:25.849 --> 20:27.893
[Curse] You are not a Sorcerer.

20:29.144 --> 20:30.979
You are a fake.

20:32.397 --> 20:35.067
[Risu] Why? Why was I killed?

20:36.860 --> 20:40.072
[Curse] Why do you ask?
You should already know.

20:40.155 --> 20:42.950
Who else knows about this Magic?

20:43.033 --> 20:44.701
[Risu] No... that's impossible!

20:45.369 --> 20:46.203
[Aikawa] Hey!

20:46.787 --> 20:49.414
[Risu] I bought that machine
we were talking about.

20:49.498 --> 20:51.124
The one that checks your Magic.

20:51.708 --> 20:53.418
En's brand was selling it.

20:53.502 --> 20:56.338
Anyway, I found out something amazing!

20:56.964 --> 21:00.884
It's not confirmed yet,
but I have to tell somebody!

21:03.470 --> 21:04.763
[Aikawa gasps]

21:05.264 --> 21:06.265
Risu!

21:06.765 --> 21:09.476
Risu, don't you recognize me?

21:09.559 --> 21:12.896
It's Aikawa. Your partner, remember?

21:13.563 --> 21:15.816
[Risu] I know, Aikawa. [grunts weakly]

21:15.899 --> 21:17.943
There's no way I'd forget you.

21:18.652 --> 21:20.904
[Aikawa] What the hell happened to you?

21:21.405 --> 21:23.282
It must've been something terrible.

21:23.782 --> 21:26.076
It's okay. I'm here for you.

21:26.159 --> 21:28.328
Let's go back to school together.

21:28.412 --> 21:29.454
What do you say?

21:30.205 --> 21:31.331
[Risu] Hmm.

21:31.415 --> 21:33.583
[Aikawa] All right, are you hungry?

21:34.084 --> 21:35.585
I'll get you something to eat.

21:35.669 --> 21:37.838
I'd like that, Aikawa.

21:37.921 --> 21:39.256
[Aikawa] Don't mention it.

21:42.926 --> 21:45.345
- [footsteps fading]
- [door opening]

21:53.937 --> 21:55.147
Where am I?

21:55.230 --> 21:56.690
[groans] What's going on?

21:57.232 --> 21:58.817
I remember the Cross-Eyes...

21:58.900 --> 22:01.111
[gasps] Hey, Shin! Shin, where--

22:01.194 --> 22:03.864
- [Sho] You finally woke up, huh?
- Huh?

22:03.947 --> 22:08.368
[Sho] It took you
an unusually long time to recover, Noi.

22:08.952 --> 22:11.121
It's been a month since I found you.

22:11.204 --> 22:13.623
[gasps] You... I can't believe it's...

22:15.834 --> 22:18.378
- Wait, who are you again?
- [Sho] Huh? It's me!

22:18.462 --> 22:20.630
I'm a member of the En family!

22:20.714 --> 22:23.383
The sorcerer who can
make anything invisible!

22:23.467 --> 22:25.635
- [dramatic music playing]
- I'm Sho!

22:25.719 --> 22:27.387
Oh, you're Sho!

22:28.221 --> 22:32.100
I went on a journey
straight after the Blue Night Festival.

22:32.184 --> 22:34.144
But when I heard that En was dead,

22:34.227 --> 22:38.940
I returned to the mansion in secret
and kept watch over all of you.

22:39.024 --> 22:42.319
You stayed invisible with your Magic? Why?

22:42.402 --> 22:43.695
Because it seemed like

22:43.779 --> 22:46.281
everyone had completely forgotten
about me.

22:47.407 --> 22:49.868
I used to work as an assassin
for the family,

22:49.951 --> 22:53.705
but, maybe because of my Magic,
I have a weak presence.

22:53.789 --> 22:57.918
En was pretty much the only person
who ever spared a thought for me.

22:58.001 --> 23:00.379
I was at the Blue Night Festival, remember?

23:01.338 --> 23:02.255
Hmm?

23:02.339 --> 23:03.965
Oh! Of course you were.

23:04.049 --> 23:05.926
I definitely remember that.

23:06.009 --> 23:08.637
You're the one who saved me. Great.

23:08.720 --> 23:10.138
Now tell me what a happened to Shin!

23:10.222 --> 23:12.140
Why don't we start with some clothes?

23:12.724 --> 23:14.518
- Shin is, well...
- [gasps]

23:14.601 --> 23:16.520
[Sho] He's probably already...

23:16.603 --> 23:17.771
[Noi] Huh?

23:20.023 --> 23:21.483
[uneasy music playing]

23:23.735 --> 23:25.362
Poor Shin...

23:25.862 --> 23:31.034
I tried using repair-type smoke,
anything to bring Shin back to normal,

23:31.118 --> 23:34.454
but it took everything I had
just to keep the mushrooms fresh.

23:34.955 --> 23:35.914
Huh? Noi!

23:35.997 --> 23:38.917
Hold on! You're still recovering.

23:39.000 --> 23:43.004
Besides, the Cross-Eyes boss's Magic
is different from En's.

23:45.257 --> 23:46.425
Oh!

23:46.508 --> 23:48.844
I'm not gonna let that bastard win.

23:49.344 --> 23:50.929
To hell with his Magic!

23:53.515 --> 23:54.808
[air whooshing loudly]

23:54.891 --> 23:55.725
[Sho gasps]

23:55.809 --> 23:57.894
What incredible smoke density!

23:57.978 --> 23:59.646
[suspenseful music building]

24:12.284 --> 24:13.785
- [music fades]
- [blowing slows]

24:14.369 --> 24:15.829
[Shin exhales slowly, gasps]

24:15.912 --> 24:16.830
[gasping]

24:16.913 --> 24:19.332
- Wh... what are you... [coughs]
- [uplifting music playing]

24:19.416 --> 24:21.251
Shin, you're alive!

24:21.793 --> 24:23.086
Thank goodness! I...

24:23.170 --> 24:24.921
- I'm so glad! [sobbing]
- [Shin gasps]

24:25.005 --> 24:26.256
[Shin, confused] Uh...

24:30.510 --> 24:33.263
Thanks a lot, Noi.

24:34.014 --> 24:35.098
[Sho] Wow...

24:35.599 --> 24:37.976
They're already forgetting that I exist.

24:39.019 --> 24:41.313
Maybe I should just disappear.

24:42.481 --> 24:43.565
[music fades]

24:47.027 --> 24:48.820
[Japanese theme song playing]

26:14.698 --> 26:15.907
THE END

26:15.991 --> 26:18.076
[narrator] What we learned in Episode 21.

26:18.159 --> 26:20.745
When Shin gets serious,
he puts on his mask facing forward.

26:20.829 --> 26:22.998
The Cross-Eyes got
their long-cherished wish.

26:23.081 --> 26:24.833
Aikawa and Risu reunited.

26:24.916 --> 26:29.004
What we're going to learn in Episode 22,
it's still lost in chaos.

26:29.087 --> 26:30.922
This is Dorohedoro.
